# Ledgerline: repo-root ignores. Philosophy: commit small text/JSON run
# manifests + summaries; never commit per-run scratch (vegeta target fixtures,
# raw .bin attack logs, full DB dumps). Those are not published; see results/README.md.

# --- results/ scratch ------------------------------------------------------
# Per-run IO scratch: vegeta targets + request bodies the runner stages before
# each attack. Big, regenerable, never a data source.
results/**/io/
# Capacity-gate request-body fixtures (staged outside io/, same scratch nature).
results/**/bodies/
# Raw attack logs / binary captures and DB dumps (regenerable, not published).
results/**/*.bin
results/**/*.dump
# Raw per-window traces: cgroup 50 ms cpu/mem samples + per-second p99 series.
# Tens of MB per run, regenerable-grade detail; the committed *.summary.json
# roll-ups carry the headline, and CHECKSUMS.committed.sha256 covers exactly what
# IS published (see results/README.md for the artifact policy). Not published.
results/**/*.csv
# Capacity-gate vegeta targets fixture (staged scratch, same nature as bodies/).
results/**/capacity-gate/targets.txt
# Keep: manifests, *.summary.json/*.warmup.json roll-ups, report/, ledger.json,
# verdict.json, doctor.json, CHECKSUMS: small text summaries committed.
# Rehearsal + smoke runs are never a data source: only the published full
# measured run is committed (see results/README.md). Smoke runs are matched by
# prefix; anything else under results/ is committed unless a rule above excludes
# it, so a future published run cannot be ignored by accident.
results/smoke-*/

# --- bench (Python runner) -------------------------------------------------
bench/.venv/
bench/**/__pycache__/
bench/.pytest_cache/
*.pyc

# --- services/dotnet build output ------------------------------------------
services/dotnet/bin/
services/dotnet/obj/
services/dotnet/Ledgerline.Tests/bin/
services/dotnet/Ledgerline.Tests/obj/

# --- editor / IDE ----------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user

# --- OS noise --------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
